  "priorExpiration": "2017-03-14",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3704.01 Reinstatement of Bail.\n\n(a) When a court orders reinstatement of a bail forfeiture that was originally deposited to the default bench warrant fund, the division shall mail a check to the administrative office of the courts to remove that amount from the default bench warrant fund.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 597:38-b, the administrative office of the courts shall process the reinstatement under paragraph (a) which shall be returned to the offender.\n\nSource. #5485, eff 10-14-92; ss by #6855, INTERIM, eff 10-14-98, EXPIRES: 2-11-99; ss by #6890, eff 1-1-99; ss by #8665, eff 6-19-06, EXPIRED: 6-19-14\n\nNew. #11175, INTERIM, eff 9-15-16, EXPIRES: 3-14-17; ss by #12120, eff 2-23-17\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3700.html"
